course: dictionary
lesson: 7787
title: One word, more than one meaning
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. Context, meaning the words around the word, tells you which meaning is right. «A duck's quack does echo; it is just quiet and hard to hear.» Here quack is the sound a duck makes, so you can picture it.
explain: Quack can also mean a person who pretends to be a doctor and sells fake cures. Look for clues like cure, pills or doctor. A quack doctor is someone who claims to heal people but cannot really do it.
explain: Check your meaning by putting it into the sentence. If the sentence still makes sense, you are probably right. If it sounds silly, read the words around it again and try another meaning.
fact: A quack is the loud, harsh sound a duck makes. To quack means to make that sound.
fact: A quack is also a person who pretends to be a doctor and sells cures that do not work.
fact: «Quack remedy» and «quack medicine» mean a fake cure.
fact: In UK and Australian slang, «the quack» can be a joking word for a real doctor.
fact: «Coin-coin» is the French word for the sound quack quack, just as «miaou» is the French word for miaow.
exercise: «A duck's quack does echo; it is just quiet and hard to hear.» What is a quack in this sentence? | A kind of warm hat | *A loud, harsh sound a duck makes | A doctor who sells fake cures | A small pond in a park
exercise: Mum says the man selling magic pills with no proof is a quack. What does quack mean here? | A duck making a noise | *A person who pretends to be a doctor and sells fake cures | A real doctor who is very kind | A funny song for young children
exercise: «French animal noises: ouaf ouaf (woof woof), miaou (miaow), cocorico (cock-a-doodle-doo), meuh (moo), coin-coin (quack quack).» Copy the French word for quack quack. | meuh | ouaf | miaou | *coin-coin
test: In «The ducks began to quack loudly», what kind of word is quack? | *A verb, an action word | An adjective, a describing word | A noun, a name for a thing
test: In «a quack remedy», what does quack describe? | A loud noise at night | *A cure that does not work | A real hospital | A duck's song
exam: Grandma says, «Don't trust that quack», about a man selling magic pills. What does she mean? | He is a joke about ducks | He sounds like a duck | *He pretends to be a doctor, and his cures are fake | He is a real doctor who is very kind
